description:
Job Description Journeyman Electrician ATI has an immediate opening for a full-time Journeyman Electrician right off the Capital Beltway in Prince George's County in Clinton, Maryland. Great Pay and Benefits for a Journeyman Electrician: 
 Competitive pay rate; $36.28 - $47.00/hour depending on benefits chosen; 
 11 annual paid holidays; 
 Minimum of 2 weeks of paid annual leave; 
 Up to 56 hours of annual paid sick time (based on the Service Contract Act (SCA)); 
 Medical, dental, vision,…
